The following is a letter from Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin: Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin sends a message of congratulations to Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit on the occasion of the National New Year
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, President of the National Assembly, sent a congratulatory message to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Samdech Kittipritthbandit on the occasion of the upcoming National New Year, 2560 A.D.
In his congratulatory message, Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin said, "On this auspicious occasion, I would like to express my sincere appreciation for Samdech Techo's outstanding heroic example of contributing to the struggle for national liberation, peace and national unity." "Build and develop the country to be as prosperous as it is now."
Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin continued that the Royal Government under the wise leadership of Samdech Techo has made the Kingdom of Cambodia achieve great successes, maintain peace and stability to develop the country more momentum. Progress with confidence and gain decent prestige both within the regional framework and on the international stage.
The following is a message from Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin:
The Union of Federation of Cambodian Journalists has decided to establish the Cambodian Online Press Committee.
The CCHR further stated that the establishment of the Cambodian Online Press Committee is in line with the necessity and practical context of technological developments in journalism to complement the online journalism unit in Cambodia by providing various means of support, including These include: training, finding ways to provide financial and leadership support, exchanging experiences, defending rights, and promoting the role of outreach that is valuable to Cambodian society and people.
At the same time, the CJCC strongly believes that the Cambodian Online Press Committee will use this opportunity to develop its unit to a higher value, both nationally and internationally.
Kampong Cham Provincial Governor Instructs Education Department Officials to Strengthen Their Capacity in Addition to Achievements
