Director of Kampong Cham Provincial Department of Education, Youth and Sports, Mr. Ly Meng San, said that since the Royal Government reformed the education sector from 2014 to 2019, the achievements of the Provincial Department of Education include four good directors, teachers. 3 good, 5 excellent teachers, 1 recitation, 1 reading, 8 painting, 3 poetry recitation, 1 clean school environment.
