At the same time, the Governor of Kampong Cham Province, Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, highly appreciated and thanked for all the support from the Royal Government, as well as the participation of the national-international community, development partners, local authorities, philanthropists, parents, youth and students. Who has actively contributed to the development of education, youth and sports in Kampong Cham to be proud of.
The prize to be awarded to the winner is the best teacher in Khmer language, ranked No. 1 nationwide, received a budget of 2.5 million Riels, and the next ranking received a prize money of 1.5 million Riels. .
