4,500 cases of Cambodian pure water distributed to patients at Kuntha Bopha Hospital for free
(Phnom Penh): Khmer Breweries has partnered with Kuntha Bopha Hospital to distribute 4,500 cases of 1.5 liters of Cambodian pure water to patients at Kantha Bopha Hospital from today.
The Cambodian Pure Water Distribution Program will take place from 8 am to 11 am at the corner of the fourth entrance of Kuntha Bopha IV Hospital in Srah Chak Sangkat, Doch Penh District.
Both types of Cambodian pure water are distributed to patients for drinking during hospitalization and to improve the well-being of children and the use of clean water.
Please also note that there are two types of Cambodian pure water: Cambodian pure water contains minerals rich in minerals to help bones, hydrate the body and help moisturize the skin, while Cambodian pure water drinking water is high in minerals and is mineral. 100% purified, which helps to hydrate the skin, moisturizes the skin and can be used as a high quality pure water for cooking with baby milk powder.
