(Phnom Penh): Through a message to his compatriots on the occasion of the National New Year, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, announced his strong commitment to overcome all obstacles, maintain peace and deepen reforms. To promote the development of the country and build a better life for the people.
In a message released to the public on April 8, 2019, Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that "the Royal Government of Cambodia will continue to make every effort to maintain peace, political stability and security. "And strengthen public order, protect the Constitution, protect the monarchy in accordance with the national motto, religion, the King and protect all the achievements of the Royal Government and the people as a whole in the past."
In addition to his commitment to maintaining peace, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also announced the continuation of in-depth state reforms through the approach of "mirroring, bathing, healing and surgery", including strengthening good governance through strengthening National and sub-national institutions, decentralization and deconcentration reforms and the fight against corruption, human resource development, and improving the quality of the education system.
In addition, the Royal Government will improve the social protection system, improve the quality of health services and build physical infrastructure, roads, bridges and irrigation, increase electricity sources, develop industry, handicrafts, transportation services, trade, tourism and agriculture. More.
With the commitment to achieve new achievements for the nation and the people, in this message to the Cambodian people, the Head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, also highlighted the many achievements that the Royal Government of Cambodia led by Samdech himself has strived to achieve great benefits for the nation and the people in the old year as well.
In 2018, the Royal Government of Cambodia also announced its strong commitment to deepen reform and encourage more investors to invest in Cambodia, while the Royal Government has organized trade facilitation to strengthen Competitiveness for investors in Cambodia under the umbrella of peace, democracy, freedom, pluralism without discrimination.
At the same time, the Royal Government also plans to increase the income of civil servants and the Armed Forces to receive higher salaries from year to year, which in 2018, the salaries of civil servants and the Armed Forces have increased. Reached more than 1 million Riel and paid on time, twice a month through the banking system.
In addition to efforts to improve economic growth, trade, increase the salaries of civil servants and improve services for the people, and that 2018 is the year that the Royal Government pays high attention. On the construction of infrastructure, roads, bridges and many other sectors.
