He added that today we will all see workers in the Phnom Penh Special Economic Zone not only have factory skills, they also have their own unique artistic abilities and talents.
At the end of the meaningful impression, Mr. Chea Vuthy wished all the guests, guests, as well as all the workers who came to visit a lot tonight to experience the four blessings of the Buddha: age, caste. Bliss: Do not be lazy.
