Minister of Tourism: Public and private sectors in Siem Reap need to create new tourism products to meet the needs of guests outside of Angkor
(Siem Reap): The Minister of Tourism, Mr. Thong Khon, said that tourists who visit Siem Reap not only visit Angkor Wat, but they also need other tourism products besides Angkor Wat during the construction. New tourism products are not yet in demand.
According to the report of the Director of the Siem Reap Provincial Department of Tourism, Mr. Ngov Sengkak, said that the provincial authorities as well as the Department of Tourism of Siem Reap are also trying to promote the organization of "Siem Reap outside the temples of Angkor" with the private sector gradually.
Mr. Chuk Chumnor continued that in addition, there are links to the temples of Preah Vihear and Koh Ker temples in Preah Vihear province, Beng Mealea or Boeung Mealea in Svay Leu district, Sambor Prei Kuk temple area in Kampong Thom province and to Wat Phu temple in Laos. Which is a heritage tour.
The director of the Department of the Ministry of Tourism added that the organization of cultural performances in restaurants, hotels in Siem Reap, supermarkets, entertainment venues in Siem Reap district is also a tourist attraction.
He said, however, that small-scale tourist destinations and resorts of some private sectors do not seem to have attracted the attention of international tourists yet, this may be due to the fact that travel agencies do not organize tours for visitors.
In the same meeting, Minister Thong Khon further advised that the public and private sectors in the tourism sector must jointly create more tourism products and tourist resorts to meet the interests and entertainment needs of international tourists. Visitors to Cambodia have the opportunity to stay longer, longer months and spend more.
He said that the development or construction of any building in Siem Reap must be thoroughly studied and properly authorized by the authorities because Siem Reap - Angkor is an ancient heritage city, inherited from ancestors.
He mentioned some experiences about some tourist sites that do not have new tourist attractions, leaving tourists without new attractions and leaving early.
