(Phnom Penh): On the International Day of Buddhism on April 8, 2019, Senior Minister Him Chhem, Minister of Cult and Religion, said that April 8 is the International Day of Buddhism and confers the highest honor on the Queen. Mr. Thomic Reach ”to His Majesty King Samdech Preah Boromneath Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia.
