Samdech Techo Hun Sen Calls on the National Bank and Stakeholders to Preserve the Riel Currency and Collect History of Cambodia's Currency (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on April 08, 2012. This year 2019 calls on the National Bank and all stakeholders to jointly preserve the heritage of the riel and collect the history related to the Cambodian currency to be displayed in the museum.
