Samdech Techo stated that in this spirit, in order for the Museum of Economy and Currency to contribute more actively in the cause of strengthening the knowledge of the people of Cambodia to better understand the history of Cambodian currency in all eras, especially to promote the Cambodian Riel through the use The riel is widely used throughout the country to strengthen our national identity and national sovereignty.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized, "I urge the National Bank of Cambodia and all stakeholders to continue to participate in preserving the heritage and collecting all artifacts related to the currency for display in the museum."
