Arrest of a Military Officer of the Road Construction Engineering Department of the Ministry of National Defense Engineering Department in Mondulkiri Province after firing multiple shots for entering alcohol
(Mondulkiri): Two angry military officers of the Road Construction Engineering Division of the Ministry of National Defense Engineering Department were arrested by the police of Sen Monorom City immediately after several firearms exploded in the center of Sen Monorom City, Mondulkiri Province. At Lim Peng Khun Market, next to the karaoke shop "Bopha Isan", Chamkar Te Village, Sangkat Spean Meanchey this morning, April 7, 2019.
Immediately after the arrest, a military officer named Sem Piro was transferred to the Mondulkiri Provincial Gendarmerie Headquarters for processing.
According to the report, the military officer who was detained was a member of the Road Construction Engineering Force of the Ministry of Defense's Engineering Department, who had been drinking with his partner all night until the early hours of the morning. Prior to the incident, the military officer intended to drive out of the bar, but a woman stopped and locked the car to leave because he was very drunk for fear of a traffic accident.
For this case, Mr. Kan Penh, Police Inspector of Sen Monorom City, who led the arrest operation, said that the shooter had been handed over to the Gendarmerie for further action.
According to the commander, two military officers may have their unit chiefs come to bail them out for education.
