In order to prevent and prevent road traffic accidents during this event, the National Road Safety Committee would like to appeal to the public as road users as follows:
* First: Always check the technical characteristics of the vehicle, especially the steering wheel, side lights, etc.
* Second: Please do not load passengers or cargo beyond the limit. For new vehicles carrying passengers or workers, do not load passengers or workers or on the roof and please do not increase the fare on this occasion.
* Third: Always wear a helmet when traveling by motorcycle.
* Fourth: Always wear a seat belt when traveling by car.
* Fifth: Always respect the right of way, obey traffic signs and always be right.
* 7th: Do not drive under the influence of alcohol.
* 9th: Do not drive in a drowsy state and have a backup driver to change shifts.
* 11th: It is forbidden to spray water on road users.
