The most brutal murder! Murderer beheads two women, leaving their bodies missing in Prey Chhor district, Kampong Cham province
(Kampong Cham): A horrific incident caused a surprise on the afternoon of April 3, 2019, when two bodies were found beheaded in Trapeang Boeung village, Thmor Poun commune, Prey Chhor district. Kampong Cham.
According to the local police, at noon on April 3, 2019, the Thmor Poun Administration Post received information from Deung Thorn, a 35-year-old female in Trapeang Boeung village, Thmor Poun commune, that her mother, Uncle Oun, 65, was missing. And 6-year-old niece Kheng Savoeun disappeared from the house in the morning without knowing where they were and asked the police to help with the investigation.
Immediately after receiving his oral complaint and request, the Thmar Poun Police Force, in cooperation with the victims 'families, searched the bodies of the two victims in the forest about 350 meters south of the victims' houses. The bodies were still separated, with no heads.
Authorities confirmed that the suspect has not been identified in this case, while the specialized police force is continuing to investigate to deal with the procedure.
