Third, the lawyer of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Mr. Kitech, decided to file a complaint to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court against Mr. Pheng Vannak for using Facebook to spread public defamation against Samdech Techo Hun Sen. The Prime Minister of Cambodia will have the full intention of inciting to commit crimes, in particular, in violation of the provisions of Article 305 and Article 494-495 of the Penal Code.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen's Lawyer Kitech's Complaint against Mr. Pheng Vannak Based on Fresh News Complaints and Evidence Filed in Court on March 29, 2019 April 1, 2019 of Cambodian Lawyers for International Cooperation.
Fourth, on the afternoon of April 2, 2019, hours after the police arrested Mr. Pheng Vannak, Mr. Khan Sovann, known as a social media user, filed a complaint with the Phnom Penh Municipal Court to sue Mr. Pheng Vannak and Five factions committed crimes and demanded more than $ 1 million in damages and damages.
