(Phnom Penh): A sister carrying her child ran to meet the bodyguard of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, during his visit to the first Chroy Changvar bridge on the morning of April 3, 2019. Trying to get close to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, she did not have to ask for anything, just to express her gratitude for the merits of Samdech who brought peace and development for the Cambodian nation.
What's even more surprising is that her younger sister's daughter also seems to be very close. Just meet Samdech immediately, this girl greeted Samdech and ran to hug Samdech tightly. Gestures show that this girl is as close to Samdech as her grandfather.
Through this picture, it is clear that although what Samdech has done for Cambodia from 1977 during the first struggle until the liberation of the country from the Pol Pot regime in 1979 and the development of the country 40 years after this liberation can not satisfy some people. However, the people of Cambodia, almost a kingdom, gave the truth of what Samdech did for the nation and the people of Cambodia with deep respect.
Clients of Ly Hour Microfinance Institution Plc. Receive Accident Insurance Compensation from the Company
(Phnom Penh): A man who is a client of Ly Hour Microfinance Institution Plc., Living in Chea Khlang Commune, Svay Antor District, Prey Veng Province, borrowed 2 million Riels in Nano Credit at Svay Antor District Branch, Prey Veng Province. Personal injury of Ly Hour Insurance Company, a business partner of Ly Hour Microfinance Institution Plc.
Unfortunately, when he was having lunch with his teammates and friends at home, he fell on his back in bed, causing a serious accident. After being hospitalized for 12 days, he died.
On that occasion, the family also thanked Lyhour Microfinance Institution Plc. And Lyhour Insurance Company, a partner company, for the speedy payment of insurance premiums to his family and also said that the use of services The insurance really helped her family in a difficult situation as her husband was the stand, the whole family died leaving him and the children.
She also called on her villagers to use the Nano Credit service, which not only helps to solve the family's livelihood in an emergency, but also reduces the burden on the family when someone is in danger of causing permanent disability or Until the loss of life.
Ly Hour Microfinance Institution Plc. Has developed a new product that is unprecedented in the financial market in Cambodia by partnering with Ly Hour Verluy and Ly Hour Insuren, a subsidiary of Ly Hour Group. Nano Loan is a type of loan with a loan size of up to 6 million riels, does not require collateral and is associated with personal accident insurance with up to $ 10,000.
Nano loan has the benefit of being a reserve to meet the urgent needs of cash, such as: helping families in an emergency, treating illnesses, purchasing equipment, paying for their children's tuition and other necessities, to make it easier to do so. Transactions Customers can withdraw and pay loans with membership card anytime, anywhere with Ly Hour Verluy agents throughout Cambodia.
