According to the report of Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police, on April 3, 2019, on March 1, 2019 at 23:30, there were cases of possession and use of weapons and incursions in casinos caused by ethnic people. China, located in Village 4, Sangkat 4, Sihanoukville. A group of Chinese shareholders in the casino stormed the "Pao Mai" casino (at the manager's place), forcing all the guests who were gambling in the casino to run away.
