Immediately after receiving this information, the Criminal Police Planning Unit cooperated with the Sihanoukville Police Inspectorate, Special Intervention Force, 4th Police Station and related forces to arrive at the scene and arrest 8 suspects who were holding The baton was in his hand, and many of his followers escaped.
