Mr. Eng Ratana called on all enterprises and companies that have not yet paid taxes to the state to participate in fulfilling this tax obligation properly because the Royal Government encourages small and medium enterprises if they are willing to pay taxes to the state. Taxes will be waived for the first three years, and previously unpaid taxes will also be waived.
He said that in the last five years, the General Department of Taxation has collected more than the actual plan in 2018, the General Department of Taxation has collected more than 2 billion dollars, and in the first three months of 2019 collected more than 800 Millions of dollars.
