Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen Inaugurating Kampot Water Supply System worth More Than 26 Million USD
(Kampot): On Tuesday, April 13, 2019, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, inaugurated the Kampot Provincial Water Supply System. Built with the help of the Japanese government, worth more than 26 million US dollars.
Construction of the Kampot water supply system began in July 2016 and was completed in August 2018. Through this water supply system, the Kampot Water Supply Authority has a total production capacity of 13,260 cubic meters per day, which is more than twice the previous production capacity.
The following are the main remarks of Samdech Techo Hun Sen:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Japanese government for always helping to solve Cambodia's problems, including the supply of clean water.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in Phnom Penh, the supply of clean water to about two-thirds of the population is with the help of the Japanese government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen added that the water supply system inaugurated today will help solve many problems for the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the construction site of the water management system now is not far from the location where Japan built the airport to use in the past to serve the management of Cambodia. But Japan's position from the past is wrong now.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also reminded of the success of Samdech's two strategies that led to Kampot province as well as Cambodia as a whole to achieve peace and development.
* Samdech continued that the two strategies are to turn the former war zone into a zone of peace, development zone and another market is the implementation of the strategy of turning the border area into a zone of peace, friendship, development and cooperation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is currently in talks with Laos and Thailand to open a number of border crossings to expand trade with each other.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Kampot is one of the least developed provinces and also the province with the most governors.
* Samdech Techo stated that the development of Kampot province starts from finding peace and setting out the right leadership strategy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that on April 3, Samdech and the Ambassador of Japan will walk hand in hand across the first Chroy Changvar Bridge, which will be reopened after repair.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen issued an order to build a diversion dam for
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen orders Senior Minister Cham Prasidh, Minister of Industry and Handicrafts, to chair a meeting to build a dam to extract fresh water to supply people and to prevent salt water from flowing into fresh water supply.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people to use water and electricity sparingly
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that being the leader of the country is not easy, you have to think about all the water and electricity issues of the people and many other issues.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen spoke angrily to analysts about the lack of electricity, claiming that analysts do not understand anything
* Samdech Techo warns to cut off electricity consumption in the homes of those analysts.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen considers that the analysts who always criticize the case of power outage as an excuse to increase hydropower is a baseless criticism.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he did not use obscene language like the President of the Philippines, as he only used profanity.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen considers analysts who often criticize power outages as an excuse to increase hydropower to be baseless criticism.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen claims that climate change remains a common concern of people around the world.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen mentioned that Samdech and Samdech Kittipritthbandit have Japanese names that Japanese doctors submitted to Samdech in the past.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister said that Samdech always puts more eyes on him, whether in the country or abroad.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen to send data on electricity generation every day to Samdech so that Samdech can know the data of power shortage.
