* Samdech Techo Prime Minister said that due to the wrong assessment of the opposition politicians, they never won.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that all armed forces must not retaliate against Sam Rainsy, who called on the army to revolt.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen believes in the quality of Japanese construction that has helped build achievements in Cambodia.
* The head of the Royal Government of Cambodia said that of all the Japanese aid, the prince only came to cut the ribbon, and the Japanese money was his own, not his own.
