Ministry of Public Works announces the combined payment of salaries of civil servants and contracted officers for April and before Khmer New Year
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Public Works on April 1, 2019 announced the payment of salaries to civil servants and contracted officials for April, before the Khmer New Year. Including 50,000 riel stipend, which is also sponsored by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
First, the payroll for April is to be paid once a month, including allowances during the traditional New Year and to reach each individual no later than April 12. 2019.
Second: Payroll for May and subsequent months shall be prepared every two weeks in accordance with the spirit of Circular No. 07S dated 12 December 2018 on setting procedures for payroll every two weeks. Once a week, once a month to civil servants and other public officials.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen further stated that from May 2019 onwards, the payment of salaries is carried out as usual, twice a month or every two weeks.
