Very symphonic! A grandmother was killed by lightning in Phnom Kravanh district, Pursat province.
(Pursat): A police report obtained by Fresh News on April 1 said that at least one grandmother lost her life and a newlywed couple was seriously injured and sent to the emergency room due to the incident. Natural disaster Lightning strikes after the end of a wedding ceremony.
This incident happened at 3:00 pm on March 31, 2019 yesterday at the wedding point in Chrey Krem village, Phteah Rong commune, Phnom Kravanh district, Pursat province.
At the time of the incident, the sky was dark with rain mixed with fierce thunderstorms. Suddenly, lightning struck, killing the grandmother in the basement, and the newlyweds were seriously injured.
According to the report, the couple had just gotten married and had not yet moved out of the house when a lightning strike occurred. At present, the bodies of the victims' grandmothers are being prepared for a traditional funeral, while the two victims, a couple, are being treated at home.
