Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen Presenting Diplomas to More Than 3,000 Vanda Institute Students
(Phnom Penh): On Monday, April 12, 2019, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presented diplomas to 3,213 female students of Vanda Institute. 2,704 students after they successfully graduated in the 2017-2018 school year.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has paid attention and efforts on education, which has been the engine in the development of human resources, national development since the time of the Cambodian state, even before the Paris Agreement.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that as the New Year approached, the year of the coup d'état, March 18, 1970, was marked by the fall of Cambodia into the fires of war. Samdech Techo stated that without a coup d'etat and let His Majesty King Norodom Sihanouk lead, Cambodian society will prosper.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that without a coup d'état, Cambodian society would not have been devastated for about three decades.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that only after the 1990s did Cambodia have the opportunity to re-develop the country and make the people have a better income today. But what is the biggest opportunity from this peaceful society is for young Cambodians to study and gain knowledge.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that after the coup d'etat of March 18, 1970, the country began to be chaotic and the youth no longer had the opportunity to receive education.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that 20 years of peace in Cambodia has provided sufficient opportunities for young people to study.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that so far, Samdech's scholarship students have nearly 20,000.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the migration before 1970 was to find new jobs, after the 1970 coup migrated from the war zone.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Vanda Institute for its contribution to the training of students and also congratulated all the students who successfully graduated.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the people for participating in the culture of paying taxes, which led to a higher income.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the salary for April is paid before Khmer New Year and the allowance of 50,000 Riel is paid separately, not every two weeks.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told the opposition to sit and wait to see the fall of the Royal Government, please wait and see. Samdech Techo stated that the Royal Government is not only able to increase the salary of civil servants, but also able to open every two weeks.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that the clip of the insult has already been sent to the embassies and confirmed to the ambassadors that this insult is something that Samdech can not mention for Sam Rainsy.
* The Prime Minister claimed that this insult led to Samdech launching a policy to get rid of Sam Rainsy prisoners, just as Samdech set a policy to get rid of Pol Pot.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this insult cannot be reconciled and excused.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has already suffered from injustice. Samdech Techo continued that some countries claim to be democrats but support the coup to overthrow Samdech Norodom Sihanouk. Samdech Techo questioned whether the country expressed its regret for supporting this coup and supporting the Khmer Rouge seat at the United Nations?
* Samdech Techo stated that Cambodia is fed up with economic and political blockades. It is very difficult to move to the current situation.
* Samdech Techo, Head of the Royal Government, continues to call on people to make efforts to save water during the rainy season. Samdech Techo also called on people to be very careful about the wind.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called on the Red Cross, the authorities and the armed forces to resolve in time for the people affected by the wind.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also called on people to pay attention to lighting incense candles so as not to cause fire.
