The Director General of the Rural Development Bank requests the rice seed production community in Battambang province to increase the production of pure rice seeds and distribute them to farmers so that traders do not have an excuse to lower the price!
The purpose of this discussion is to ask the rice seed production community to expand the production of pure rice seeds in a technical way, to establish a center for the production and distribution of pure rice seeds, to coordinate agricultural production contracts between seed producers and seed companies, to encourage Farmers grow pure rice varieties.
Mr. Kao Thach added that in 2019, your rice yield has decreased due to weather factors and some problems, which is why the price of rice has decreased compared to previous years. But at the same time, the biggest problem that contributes to the decline in rice yields is that some farmers have grown unsightly rice varieties, resulting in lower yields and poor yields, causing traders to lower prices. .
Seeing this rice seed factor, Mr. Kao Thach asked the representatives of the 32 rice seed production communities in Battambang province to increase the production of pure rice seeds and gather as a rice seed center to distribute to farmers in the area to grow pure rice seeds. In particular, the cost of producing pure rice seeds, the Rural Development Bank guarantees to reduce the loan budget with the most favorable interest rate for the rice seed production community.
