Speaking on the occasion of inspecting the construction, the Senior Minister highlighted the efforts to seek funding from philanthropists and private companies to build more swimming pools in order to develop the swimming sector in Cambodia. Grow and to find more national medals in the SEA Games, which Cambodia will host in 2023.
He added that the maintenance of the swimming pool at the Olympic Stadium will take seven to eight months, and that all current athletes will be temporarily relocated to a new location. Waiting for repairs and construction to be completed.
At the same time, the Senior Minister expressed his deep gratitude to the philanthropists as well as private companies who have supported the renovation and maintenance of the swimming pool in the stadium to international standards and who participated. The development of sports in Cambodia.
