(Phnom Penh): 100 million Riel of carabao energy drink was later given to two sisters, one named Roeun Sok Chan, 34 years old, and the other named Hang Sokny, 17 years old. She lives in a rented room in Village 14, Sangkat Srah Chak, Khan Daun Penh, Phnom Penh and has a job selling rice.
