(Kampong Thom): Brigadier General Hang Thol, Chairman of Msakrang Commune Assistance Team, on March 28, 2019, led a working group to hand over funds to two families affected by the development of a stone bridge. Located in Kampong Pradum village, Msakrang commune, Stong district, Kampong Thom province.
