1: Efforts must be made to research more cases of tuberculosis of all kinds in accordance with the new direction of the national-international program
2: Care must be taken to strengthen the implementation of policies to diagnose and treat TB free of charge in order to encourage patients to receive quality DOS services as soon as possible.
3: Efforts should be made to strengthen TB prevention and treatment work for children, especially TB screening among children living close to rights with TB patients and high-risk groups such as those with diabetes, the elderly and In prison and so on.
4: Continue to strengthen cooperation between TB, drugs and TB-AIDS to further reduce the rate of illness and death due to this problem.
