Wen Gang also promised to discuss other senior ministers' requests for a positive response aimed at strengthening cooperation between the Ministry of Public Works and Transport and companies to promote infrastructure development in Cambodia, as well as further strengthen ties between the two countries. Cambodia-China to grow to another level.
