Mr. Chiao Vicheak, Deputy Governor and Chairman of the Sihanoukville Sewerage System Management Committee, added that the main purpose of promoting the construction of four wastewater storage stations in Sihanoukville is to reduce the amount of wastewater. In the past, it flowed directly into the sea to the maximum in order to avoid the impact on the hygiene of the coastal environment and the sea.
Starting from this issue, Mr. Chiao Vicheak, on behalf of the Sihanoukville Provincial Administration, believes that in the future, the problems caused by dirty water in Sihanoukville can be solved and are no longer a serious concern as before.
