(Tbong Khmum): Mr. Cheam Chansophorn, Governor of Tbong Khmum Province, on March 27, 2019, requested the Tbong Khmum Provincial Department of Agriculture, especially professional officers to cooperate with all border authorities to strictly ban the import of pigs from Neighboring countries, as African swine fever is spreading and spreading, which requires careful import and sale in the market for people to buy and eat.
