Samdech Techo Hun Sen Presides Over the Graduation Ceremony of Nearly 2,000 Teachers and Students at the National Institute of Education on the morning of March 27, 2019
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is very happy to present diplomas to student teachers.
