* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government provides the highest salaries for teachers and doctors because these two sectors are a priority for the society.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the salary of teachers in Cambodia more than $ 300 can live, but for some countries can earn or $ 3,000 can not live because of high costs and the need to pay taxes.
