C: The Small and Medium Enterprises Manufacturing and Services Working Group is chaired by Senior Minister Cham Prasidh, Minister of Industry and Handicrafts, Mr. Sok Chenda Sophea, Deputy Prime Minister and Secretary General of the Council for the Development of Cambodia, and Mr. Pich Sophoan, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Labor. Vice-Chairman and 21 other members.
