The Government of Japan amended the Law on Refugee Receipt and Immigration Management on December 8, 2018, creating two new types of work visas: "Skilled Workers 1" and "Skilled Workers 2". This law will take effect on April 1, 2019. Separately, the internship referral system still applies.
