The district governor added that while the main leaders and all competent authorities have been paying attention in the fight against drugs, please pay attention to inspect all entertainment clubs and Some complex areas to report or take further measures to effectively prevent drug problems.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen wants to reform the Cambodian judiciary by following the example of Pao Chen (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, expressed his intention to reform the Cambodian judiciary through Taking the Chinese movie as a model. Samdech Techo Hun Sen's remarks were made at the graduation ceremony for students of Phnom Penh International University this morning, March 25, 2019.
Prior to that, Samdech Techo Hun Sen was very interested in the Chinese movie Paw Chen, which has been airing on Fresh News every night, and urged other TV stations to continue broadcasting it. More broadly to promote social justice.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also urged the Cambodian courts to further strengthen their justice system, with the emphasis that no matter how big the perpetrators are, they must be investigated and prosecuted. "The reform of the judiciary and the pursuit of justice in society require that research be done to separate cases, regardless of the circumstances," he said.
Samdech also reminded that Pao Chen has three knives, including a dog's head knife for prosecuting minors who make serious mistakes, a tiger's head knife for prosecuting officials and a dragon's knife for prosecuting the royal family.
