Minister Mam Bunheng inspects the situation at public health service providers in remote areas in Preah Vihear Province (Video Inside) (Preah Vihear): Minister of Health Prof. Mam Bunheng continued to lead the team to inspect the situation Public health services to people in remote areas of Preah Vihear province.
