The Minister of Health also instructed patients and caregivers to know how to protect their health by adhering to high hygiene, health care in all seasons, especially this summer.
Please be informed that at the beginning of 2019, the Ministry of Health has continued to deploy health workers to public health facilities in a good, equitable and highly effective manner to improve the provision of health services to people living in rural areas and Remote areas.
In the process of deploying health workers, the Ministry of Health has prepared an annual recruitment plan to fill the vacancies according to the number and skills required for the services to be provided to the people, based on the staffing rules set out in the guidelines on complementary activities. For referral hospitals and guidelines on minimum action sets for health centers as well.
The Ministry of Health always gives priority to health facilities located in border areas and rural areas far from urban areas.
