Ms. Samlina made this remark while she inaugurated the new Ellis Furniture (Boeung Trabek Branch along Monivong Blvd. in front of the Ministry of Water Resources) this morning, March 24, 2019. Join a large number of honored guests.
The rapid expansion of Ellis Furniture today is due to the success and strong customer trust in a wide range of furniture and office equipment products.
