Spokesman Heng Sour: "Seniority allowance available from 2019" differs from "Seniority remuneration available before 2019"
"Pre-2019 seniority bonuses are only available to workers who have joined a factory, enterprise or establishment before 2019 under the UDC. The first stage is that we only apply to enterprises in the field of textiles, garments and footwear.
The new seniority allowance, which is available from 2019 onwards, is 15 days a year, with employers paying workers 7.5 days in June and 7.5 days in December of each year. ⁇.
He stressed that the textile, garment and footwear sector, according to economists' analysis, is global, it is high risk, investment in factories in this sector is generally less real estate and assets and more mobile from one country to another.
In particular, for other types of enterprises, there are a lot of real estate and strong assets in Cambodia, and globally, it is considered as a sector that is not easy to move from one country to another, such as textiles, clothing and footwear. In this sector, workers as well as the government face a low risk of bankruptcy by the fleeing owners.
Therefore, the payment of "remuneration" for pre-2019 seniority benefits of sectors other than textiles, clothing and footwear has been postponed until the end of 2021. Chinese film "Guardian Angel" begins filming in Cambodia
