(Phnom Penh): Mr. Kong Solida, Director General of Administration and Finance of the Ministry of Tourism, expressed his interest that while Cambodia is as peaceful as it is now, people and tourists often go out to visit the resorts, which requires officials Tourism across the country needs to pay close attention to tourists.
