(Tbong Khmum): Mr. Cheam Chansophoan, Governor of Tbong Khmum Province, urged the Governor of Tambor District to cooperate with the specialized departments to deal with all issues in their localities to monitor, discuss and facilitate immediate solutions, especially security and safety issues to the people. Citizens in accordance with the policy of safe villages-communes of the Royal Government of Cambodia, which has been put into effect effectively.
This kind of urging of the Provincial Governor was made on March 22, 2019, when he met with the leaders of civil servants, commune councils, village chiefs and all kinds of armed forces under the administration of Tambor district. To listen to challenges, suggestions and address the concerns of local people.
On that occasion, some commune authorities in Tbong Khmum province's Tambor district raised some challenges and requests to the provincial authorities to examine the possibility of assistance, especially the electricity connection in their local area and the poor people without land and shelter.
In response to the problem of electricity connection, the provincial governor assigned the department to study this issue and solve it.
He stated that he will discuss with the Department of Electricity and the Electricity Authority of Cambodia to discuss the possibility of connecting to the electricity network, especially the lack of electricity, he also asked for forgiveness, because not only in Tbong Khmum. That is lacking, that is, almost all over the country as well as our neighboring countries.
He added that the Royal Government of Cambodia also called on electricity consumers across the country to jointly reduce and save electricity consumption, because due to the high heat, the ability to generate electricity for consumption is lacking, which requires There is tolerance from consumers until the rainy season arrives to have enough electricity again.
Regarding the people requesting land, he also stated that as long as you are really poor, have no land, no real shelter, he will ask for land in the social land concession area in Kratie province to distribute to those who are really poor. And the real need.
Mr. Cheam Chansophoan also asked the village chief, commune chief to handle all problems and requests, especially those who have a real need for poverty and report to the district and continue to the provincial level to solve immediately. The most important point is to work together to maintain peace in order to continue the development of our country to be more prosperous in all areas with Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the outstanding leader of Cambodia.
