(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries has issued a notice prohibiting relevant officials from using vehicles with the ministry license plate outside of working hours, especially karaoke and massage clubs. This is according to the announcement on the use of all types of vehicles of the Ministry, which was received by Fresh News on March 22, 2019.
According to the announcement, in order to ensure the effective management of state property, prestige and dignity of the Ministry, state institutions and public officials of the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, please introduce to the leadership of the Ministry, unit leadership, leadership of the Department of Agriculture. Forestry and Fisheries Capital / Province Project Director Civil Servants on the use of special vehicles, state-owned vehicles as follows:
1: Must use vehicles with state license plates correctly, drive with dignity and strictly respect the law on road traffic.
2: Do not use vehicles with state license plates outside of the time you have to work, especially all kinds of entertainment, including clubs, karaoke, massage, etc.
3. Do not allow others to use vehicles with state license plates for other purposes that are not related to the performance of their duties.
4. To take action or complain to the competent authorities if you see other vehicles with license plates like their own. In case of non-compliance, report to the Ministry for the Ministry to request the intervention of the competent institution.
