Regarding the construction of this road, Samdech Techo Prime Minister confirmed to his compatriots that for this expressway investment project, the Royal Government of Cambodia did not borrow money from Chinese friends, it was an investment of a Chinese company in the form of construction-business. Transfer (BOT) with a contract period of 50 years, that is, after the end of the business phase, the company will return this road to Cambodia.
He added that the Chinese company that built the road did not require a loan guarantee from the Royal Government of Cambodia because the company believed in the Royal Government and believed in peace, political and macroeconomic stability and security in Cambodia.
Samdech continued that the Royal Government of Cambodia did not give land to the company to build the road, instead the company provided the government to buy land for road construction, the company applied for the right to operate the road within the time limit specified in Agreement between the company and the Royal Government of Cambodia only.
