(Phnom Penh): During the trial of the case of the murder of the widow of Chev Sovathana, the mistress of Mr. Lay Vannak, former Governor of Takeo Province, this morning, March 22, 2019, the court questioned three forensic witnesses as a group. Officials in Takeo province and experts claim that Chev Sovathana died of suicide by hanging.
The three forensic officers were: Mr. Meas Ten, Deputy Director of Technical Office of Takeo Provincial Police, Mr. Aun Noeun, Technical Director of Takeo Provincial Police and Dr. Chhou Chhuon, Director of Takeo Provincial Referral Hospital. Confirm the facts about the report and the record of examining the body of the victim at birth.
