(Phnom Penh): As Cambodia suffers from low water levels, power outages are expected to occur in more than two months. However, Cellcard will continue to be a leader in providing excellent customer service. This is according to the press release of Cellcard.
Cellcard said that in these difficult times, as the most trusted mobile operator, Cellcard will continue to work to ensure that customers can stay in touch anytime, anywhere.
As the only Cambodian mobile operator in Cambodia, Cellcard has a responsibility to bring families and businesses closer to their loved ones and allow all Cambodians to connect to the services and networks they provide. Win our trophy no matter what happens.
Cellcard, as part of the Green Energy Initiative, consumes more than 70% of our solar network, which not only helps the environment but also allows people to use our network. No distractions either.
In addition to supporting as well as keeping in touch with Cellcard customers in solar-free areas, we have deployed mobile generators to ensure that our customers can still use Cellcard's network without interruption.
Many generators are being installed every day to ensure the stability of our customer service. Looking forward to this, to ensure a good network connection, the technical team has been carefully monitoring every day and for the coming months.
Due to the disruption of the power supply, Cellcard clearly understands the needs of the customers, so the Cellcard Network Technical Team is working 24/7 to complete the installation of our backup network.
Cellcard's in-house team works tirelessly to deliver technical equipment for installation, even in difficult and remote locations. Due to our hard work, we have achieved a lot of good results. However, we would like to thank all Cellcard subscribers for their continued support in the past.
For more than 7 days after the launch of this project, Cellcard has also received the most excellent supply of mobile and internet service from our customers from the provinces. The positive support of our customers is a strong motivation and we will strive to serve our customers better every day as much as we can.
To ensure the convenience and satisfaction of all customers with Cellcard's network, all service outages, even due to power outages, will be reimbursed by Cellcard.
