Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen Presiding Over the Groundbreaking Ceremony for the $ 2 Billion Expressway Construction from Phnom Penh to Sihanoukville
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that today is a historic day for Cambodia in the construction of the Phnom Penh-Sihanoukville Expressway. Samdech Techo called the start of construction of this road a step forward from the peace of Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo stated that this expressway would not have been possible without the support of the President and Prime Minister of China, with an investment of up to 2 billion US dollars.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he personally worked with the President and Prime Minister of China to implement the Phnom Penh-Sihanoukville Expressway project.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that this expressway is an important connection between the economic poles in Phnom Penh and Sihanoukville.
* Samdech Techo stated that currently Cambodia has three main economic poles, including Phnom Penh, Siem Reap, Sihanoukville, and Samdech is also considering establishing another economic pole in the northeastern region of the country.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that Samdech is proud of the construction of this expressway because it happened during the leadership of Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that Cambodia will host the SEA Games in May 2023.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Phnom Penh-Sihanoukville Expressway is a solution to economic problems in the whole country. Especially facilitate transportation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called on people not to believe the incitement that Cambodia is selling land to China. Samdech Techo confirmed that this expressway is built in the form of construction, business and transfer, that is, after the completion of the business phase, the company will return this road to Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reiterated that Cambodia does not allow China to rule Cambodia, and China does not intend to rule Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Head of the Royal Government, stated that connectivity is the most important thing for Samdech. In that, Samdech also told the members of the Royal Government in 1998 that if the connection is only political, it will not be successful, that is, there must be a road connection.
* Samdech Techo reminded that the ministers in the Royal Government of Samdech do not have a regime for buying cars, that is, before becoming a minister, when the Minister rode the car, the Minister rode the same car. The Royal Government needs to use the money to develop roads and schools.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that about 70% of loans from China are used to build infrastructure, including roads and bridges.
* Samdech Techo, Head of the Royal Government, stated that raising money for roads, canals and hydropower projects is a priority of the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia still needs to build more expressways, such as the connection to Vietnam from Phnom Penh to Bavet, Svay Rieng and to connect to Thailand.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen presents plans to build an ASEAN Expressway connecting Phnom Penh with Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam and from Phnom Penh to Bangkok, Thailand.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he will further strengthen the capacity of the railway to use the full capacity of the road for transportation.
* In response to the allegation that Cambodia is biased against China, Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech has never rejected any foreign investment, in contrast to the country that claims that Cambodia is biased towards China, it has never put investment projects in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia welcomes all investments without closing any country. Samdech Techo continued that Cambodia only needs friends who are equal.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen requested all partners to respect the sovereignty and independence of Cambodia in all activities and partnerships.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that according to the forecast, it will rain tonight and in the next few days. If it rains, the hydropower can run to generate electricity.
* Samdech Techo asked a person in Kampong Chhnang province that Samdech led the country to lack of electricity, if Samdech came down and they came up, will there be electricity again?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is on the right track and expects all friends to understand that Cambodia's intention is to have peace to continue development.
* Samdech Techo continued that voting for the Cambodian People's Party is equal to voting in support of peace and development, as well as voting for oneself.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this afternoon, Samdech will meet with US Senators.
* Samdech Techo stated that this morning he met with the great power of China, in the evening he met with the great power of the United States. Samdech Techo said that Samdech communicates with all countries, just needs mutual respect.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that during the New Year, Samdech will fulfill his mission in China.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says he will build an international conference center in Sihanoukville.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the ASEAN Summit, which Cambodia is hosting, will be held in Sihanoukville.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen requested the understanding of the people affected by this expressway project.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if people do not cooperate in the construction of achievements, the law must be applied. Samdech Techo stated that when the nation needs it, the people must give up.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that at the beginning of 2019, Samdech released a budget of nearly 100 million US dollars to compensate for the impact on various construction projects.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announced that Samdech will do his best for the nation and the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that civil servants' salaries were up to 60 days, but now civil servants are paid twice a month and have been promoted.
* The Prime Minister stated that at present, each province of Cambodia has a lot of high schools, different from before, in each province there is only one.
