(Phnom Penh): Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, presided over the closing ceremony of a seminar on sisterhood between the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and civilian units on the afternoon of March 21.
