Ms. Dam Darini stated that at present, the work of the sisterhood has progressed steadily and so far, a total of 334 government institutions, enterprises, private companies and philanthropists have formed alliances with 92 units of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces in an atmosphere of solidarity and brotherhood. Proudly practice the art of fruitful sharing.
