(Preah Sihanouk): Officials of Preah Sihanouk Provincial Customs and Excise Department held a press conference this morning, March 21, 2019 to present 13 tax-free left-hand and right-hand drive vehicles on public roads in the province. Sihanoukville.
Mr. Tum No, Head of Sihanoukville Customs and Excise Department, said that in the first quarter of 2019, his professional officers cooperated with other professional authorities to search and seize 13 vehicles that were not yet owned. Fulfill the obligation to pay import tax in accordance with the law.
He said that from the end of 2018 to March 2019, officials from the Sihanoukville Customs and Excise Department seized a total of 27 luxury cars, both left-hand drive and right-hand drive.
Mr. Tum Nou said that for the left-hand drive vehicles whose owners have not yet fulfilled their import tax obligations, the professional officers have opened the opportunity for the owners of those vehicles to complete the tax payment procedures in accordance with the law. However, right-hand drive vehicles are confiscated as state property because right-hand drive vehicles have been banned from importing since 2016.
Mr. Tum Nou added that the professional officers of the Sihanoukville Customs and Excise Branch will continue to monitor the crime of importing tax evaded goods, especially the smuggling of duty-free vehicles to respond more actively to the instructions of the General Management. The Cambodian Customs and Excise Department and the Sihanoukville Unity Command have set out to raise more revenue for the national budget.
Mr. Tum Nou continued that the 13 duty-free imported vehicles seized by the Sihanoukville Customs and Excise officers were smuggled in by importing used car parts or used cars. In some illegal garages in Cambodia.
He added that the work of the Customs and Excise officials of Sihanoukville Province is also continuing to investigate some garages suspected of being involved in the theft of vehicles imported duty-free in Sihanoukville to crack down effectively.
