This horrific incident happened at 5 pm on March 17, 2019 at Puok Thmei village, Puok commune, Puok district, Siem Reap province, which caused the victim, a 40-year-old taxi owner named Him Chan, living in Boeung Doun Pa village, Slor Kram commune. Siem Reap City fell from a car.
