(Preah Sihanouk): The Governor of Preah Sihanouk Province, Mr. Yon Min, announced to welcome a large number of national and international tourists to visit Preah Sihanouk Province on the occasion of the Khmer New Year, which will start from the 14th to the 14th. April 16, 2019 is coming.
