He added that in addition to the three-day "Sea Festival", there will also be an additional five-day exhibition of private sector products at Independence Beach. In that, Preah Sihanouk Provincial Administration has also prepared many different types of entertainment programs on a daily basis in accordance with the Khmer tradition and provide entertainment options to the general public.
