Mr. Sochet Krisna added that currently Sihanoukville has more than 300 restaurants and canteens to serve food to multi-ethnic tourists. In addition, Sihanoukville also has beautiful beaches, beauty and hygiene, including: Prek Treng Beach, Ochheuteal Beach and Otres Beach.
Apart from this, there are some beaches on some islands that are beautiful and tourists like to visit, such as: Long Set Beach, Koh Toch Beach, Koh Rong Samloem Beach, Sok San Beach and Koh Thansur Twin Beach.
Mr. Taing Sochetkrisna calls on national and international tourists to visit Sihanoukville on the occasion of the traditional Khmer New Year from 14 to 16 April to celebrate the "sea war" that the provincial administration Sihanoukville has prepared to welcome tourists like never before.
