Mr. Bun Barang confirmed that the dissolution of the Kampot-Kep Salt Producers Association will be decided at the meeting on March 25, 2019. The plan to dismantle this is because some salt producers no longer come to join the community, others have expired their mandates and should stop immediately.
"If there are more participants on the 25th, the community will continue to function normally, but if not, it will be disbanded," he said. "By forecast, I think that after the March 25 meeting, the Kep-Kampot salt production community may be disbanded."
He added that although the Kep Salt Producers Community had been disbanded, salt production would continue as they would produce and sell on their own without the involvement of the community.
He said that on March 22, 2019, the Ministry of Industry and Handicrafts will hold a meeting to discuss the work of the salt production community.
