(Phnom Penh): Deputy Prime Minister Hor Namhong said that the Royal Government of Cambodia, under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, has always focused on the health sector to increase the well-being of all people, especially women. With difficulties in life to reduce poverty in society.
This statement was made by Deputy Prime Minister Hor Namhong on the morning of March 20, 2019, on the occasion of the Deputy Prime Minister's visit on behalf of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, inaugurating the Nokor Tep Women's Hospital. Located in Sangkat Prey Sar, Khan Dangkor, Phnom Penh.
