(Kampong Cham): Mr. Huy Meng Hong, the owner of the construction of an illegal gas station in Dai Buon village, Chrey Vien commune, Prey Chhor district, is continuing construction until March 19, 2019, despite a letter from the administration. Kampong Cham province.
According to the provincial cadastral official, the new station can only be allowed to be built if there is a gap of 200 meters or more, so for Huy Meng Hong's new station, it is opposite to the old station, so the department Kampong Cham province does not allow construction.
Mr. Lor Chanly confirmed that on October 25, 2018, the Kampong Cham Provincial Administration issued a letter to Mr. Huy Meng Hong, the owner of the building, saying that the construction did not have a building permit because it was illegal in terms of urban planning, which affected safety and order. Loss of public beauty.
The letter requires the owner to dismantle it before October 31, 2018. In case the owner does not dismantle the building, the Kampong Cham Provincial Administration will take legal action and will not be responsible for any losses and damages for the demolition.
Mr. Lor Chanly also claimed that the letter of notification after receiving the application, since October 31, 2018, the owner of the construction has suspended the construction, but did not dismantle.
