Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of receiving the "Honorary Doctorate in Political Relations" degree from Kreuk University, Thailand
The leaders of Kreuk University handed over the degree directly to Samdech Techo Hun Sen. Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross and senior officials of the Royal Government of Cambodia will also attend the award ceremony.
Kreuk University is a well-known university in Thailand, 67 years old. Mr. Cham Bunya Prasert, President of the University of Kreuk, stated that Samdech Techo Hun Sen is the first world leader to receive an honorary doctorate in political relations from Kreuk University.
The following are the main remarks of Samdech Techo Hun Sen
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he is very proud and honored that Kreuk University has awarded him an honorary doctorate in political relations.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his deep gratitude to the University Council, especially Dr. Krasae Chanavong, President of Kreuk University, Management Committee, Professors and Student Representatives of Kreuk University for studying the history of Samdech's leadership struggle. In particular, the establishment of the Samdech's win-win policy until the end of the flames of war brings peace and development as it is today.
* The Prime Minister stated that the honor of Samdech now is the honor of the beloved people of Samdech who supported and believed in the leadership of Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that the honor that Samdech received now is a strong reflection of the relationship between the people and the two countries by strengthening cooperation in areas that are growing in terms of politics, economy and trade. Cultural activities and human resource development.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that receiving an honorary doctorate degree now means a lot to Samdech and the Cambodian people. Cambodia has only achieved peace for 20 years. The last day of the war was December 29, 1998, the end of the war without bloodshed and without outside interference, the first unification in Cambodia. Never for about 500 years.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that Cambodia has now built a Victory Monument, which has the historical meaning of ending the war and representing a peaceful and victorious Cambodia, and has recorded countless social achievements for future generations. The next generation learned about Cambodian history.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that after the end of the 20-year war, Cambodia has made significant progress, maintaining an increase of about 7%.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is moving from a country that relies on agriculture to a country that relies heavily on industry and services. At the same time, we will continue our efforts to make Cambodia a high middle income country by 2030 and a high income country by 2050.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen claimed that the pride of Samdech today is the pride of the people all over the country.
