In addition, Mr. Leang Phaly also called on all residents in Rovieng district, Preah Vihear province to maintain good health, because the weather has changed a lot lately, it may make people more vulnerable. Certain diseases. If the people do not prevent in advance.
He also advised people to always have medicine near them, which is a good way to prevent themselves when their relatives have various diseases that need medicine to treat immediately, and the proper storage of this medicine. May save the lives of patients even better.
Mr. Un Chanda, Governor of Preah Vihear Province, also thanked Mr. HUN Many, a young member of the National Assembly of Kampong Speu Province and Chairman of the Seventh Committee of the National Assembly, for sending all medical teams to provide free medical treatment to the people. To keep them healthy in Rovieng district.
The Governor of Preah Vihear Province also praised and appreciated all the medical team, which are all professional doctors with many years of experience to treat people at home, which makes them believe. Highly aware of the ability as well as medical equipment of the team of doctors led by Mr. Leang Phaly.
