(Phnom Penh): The CPP Committee of the Ministry of Economy and Finance organized a lecture program on March 16, 2019 on "Background, Causes and Political Paths of the Cambodian People's Party" under the chairmanship of Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, President of the Senate and Vice President of the Cambodian People's Party.
This lecture program is organized for the following three purposes:
First, show and introduce the youth to have a deeper understanding of what is the background, cause and political path of the party.
Second, strengthen the strong foundation of trust and the unwavering support of the youth on the party.
Third, increase the potential of the party's youth activists in the cause, increase the people's trust in the party's leadership forever.
