(Kampong Thom): Donations from the Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen and President of the Cambodian Veterans Association were handed over to the disabled veterans in Krachab village, Achar Lak commune. Steung Sen town, Kampong Thom province, on March 17, 2019 yesterday.
On this occasion, Major General Som Sun, Commander of Kampong Thom Military Operation Area, President of the Provincial Cambodian Veterans Association, led his colleagues to hand over a new house to 46-year-old disabled veteran Chey Choy who joined the army in 1986 He was wounded in the battlefield during the 1989 war.
