In response to the above requests of the people, Dr. Ma Chhoeun decided to help repair rural roads and restore some canals at the request of the people. Some of them are already in the development projects of the provinces and communes.
Meanwhile, in response to the request for clean water for daily use, this area lacks a source of clean water, Dr. Ma Chhoeun decided to provide a large-scale water well to the people to use as a common property to be built in the area of Wat Pring Chrum.
In addition, Dr. Ma Chhoeun also decided to help build a house for families who are poor and homeless. On that occasion, Dr. Ma Chhoeun donated some money to the people and village defenders who participated in more than 200 people.
On that occasion, Dr. Ma Chhoeun also reminded the local authorities and all kinds of authorities to continue to pay attention to the implementation of the policy of safe villages and communes to effectively ensure the safety and security of local people. Body.
