Kampong Cham Immigration Police Arrest Vietnamese Illegal Resident
(Kampong Cham): Forces from the Office of Investigation and Procedure of the Kampong Cham Provincial Police in cooperation with the Kampong Cham Sangkat Police Station on the night of March 16, 2019 arrested a Vietnamese national who came to stay illegally (without a letter Cross-border) and intend to look for work.
After being sent to the specialized office under the guidance of Brigadier General Seth Seila, Deputy Commissioner for Immigration Planning, Colonel Chhuon Chanla, the director of the interrogation office, examined and found that the foreigner was from Yalim district, Krong district. Hanoi, Vietnam came to Cambodia on March 10, 2019 to seek employment (no identity card or passport).
With the approval of Lt. Gen. Ouk Haysila, Director of the Investigation and Enforcement Department, the foreigner was allowed to be sent to the General Department of Immigration for further processing.
