Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport, emphasized that the project includes the construction of a 57-kilometer road and a nearly 4-kilometer bridge across the Tonle Sap Lake. According to Sun Chanthol, the road and bridge project is expected to cost more than 200 million US dollars.
