Samdech Techo Hun Sen Recommends 5 Highlights of the 5th River Festival in Kampong Chhnang Province (Video inside) (Kampong Chhnang): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presides over the 5th River Festival in Kampong Chhnang Province. Kampong Chhnang province, under the theme "Rivers: Linking Peace, People and Tourism" on the night of March 16, 2019, recommended five important points, which are all meaningful words for the nation and the people of Cambodia.
The five recommendations raised by Samdech Techo Hun Sen include:
* First: We must protect the peace so that our river does not become a river of suffering like in the past.
* Second: We need to find soft sources to protect the river from landslides and landslides and find ways to release the current, prevent anarchic sandbags, prevent illegal fishing, prevent deforestation, flooding that makes our rivers lose their attraction. Tourism.
