* Third: Efforts to develop tourism in cities, towns, rivers or attractive areas along the river to attract tourists to other areas. Use points in each province to attract tourism, such as in Kampong Chhnang, there are some places that need to be expanded into attractive tourist attractions.
* Fourth: In the field of tourism related to boat travel, the prince recommended for the sea to travel to the islands to pay attention to safety.
At this point along the river must also pay attention to the safety of tourist transport, including boats or boats, but what must be taken care of and have to have airbags. For travel, be careful not to overload each boat or boat.
