General Vong Pisen continued that during the Pol Pot regime for 3 years, 8 months and 20 days, all religious beliefs, especially Buddhism, were destroyed and all the pagodas and temples in Preah Vihear were turned into warehouses, kitchens and livestock houses. At that stage, only the Cambodian People's Party dared to stand up, fight and sacrifice everything to liberate the country from the dark regime.
