Phnom Penh Military sends an electric thief to court after acting in Meanchey district
(Phnom Penh): On March 16, 2019, the competent authorities of the Criminal Investigation Office of the Phnom Penh Municipal Gendarmerie sent an electric thief to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court to be punished according to the law.
The suspect was arrested on March 11, 2019 by the Meanchey District Military Base Patrol Force. The suspect, 17-year-old Voeun Vat, acted at the CSC construction site in Prek Tanou village, Chak Angre Leu commune, Meanchey district, seizing the bags of people traveling on the road.
The survey was conducted in 134 countries and regions around the world. The survey also found that in Europe, Asia and Africa, the recognition of China as the world leader is higher than the United States, and China has the highest recognition rate in Africa. To 53%.
As is well known, due to the impact of the US debt crisis, the whole world fell into the worst financial crisis in 2008. That year, based on nearly 30 years of reform and opening up and efforts, China has become a powerful driving force to save the world economy from harm and boost global economic growth.
In the same year, a Gallup poll confirmed for the first time that China's global influence surpassed that of the United States. With the help of China, the world economy emerged from a series of crises and began to show a slow but steady growth trend.
However, some developed Western countries have not been able to face and address the issue of rational distribution of social wealth in the long run, which has led to deep differences between the rich and the poor. Debt is on the rise and local populism is on the rise.
In the face of unprecedented change in the last 100 years, countries not only need peaceful development, but also need to find development formulas, development opportunities that suit their needs and forces to guide and absorb them. Strong. This time, people are paying attention to China.
Over the years, China has adhered to new development ideas, innovation, green coordination, openness and sharing. By targeted poverty eradication, it has lifted more than 10 million poor people out of poverty each year. At the same time, "consultation, building together and sharing" is considered a golden principle.
In addition, it has established the world's largest mutually beneficial and win-win cooperation forum, with 123 countries and 29 international organizations signing cooperation documents on cable building. One ring and one road with the Chinese side has continuously become the most welcomed public product in global governance.
The Brookings Institution, a well-known US think tank, released a report in 2018 saying that China's investment and development projects could contribute to the global economic growth environmentally. The report found that China's aid programs have benefited economic growth for the countries implementing them, and not only boosted the prosperity of the regional economy, but also benefited them. The surrounding area as well.
All these facts confirm that the global governance vision on the establishment of a new type of international relations based on cooperation and win-win goals and the establishment of a common community of human beings mentioned by China is welcomed. Widely from the international community. All of this has become a core value of China's leadership in the world.
This evening, Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit presided over the celebration of the 5th River Festival in Kampong Chhnang Province
(Phnom Penh): On the evening of Saturday, March 16, 2019, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross. Will preside over the 5th River Festival in Kampong Chhnang Province.
The 5th River Festival in Kampong Chhnang province is held under the theme "Rivers: Linking Peace, People and Tourism" for 3 days from 15 to 17 March 2019.
In his message to celebrate the 5th River Festival, Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the richness of the potential for tourism along the river has been contributing to making Cambodia a tourist destination with excellence and high attractiveness and contribution Vision ASEAN is a global and warm tourism destination, while river tourism, especially Mekong tourism, has become an important tourism product for Cambodia as well as ASEAN.
In the message, Samdech Techo continued that the river is a source of livelihood, a place that trains and hides culture and civilization.
Samdech Techo added that this event is also an opportunity to strengthen the quality of services and the creation and development of new innovative tourism products, especially cruises, river tourism communities, as well as contribute to the strengthening of ties and solidarity. Between ASEAN countries and strengthened partnerships in various regional frameworks such as the Greater Mekong Subregion, Mekong-Dapon, Mekong-Mekong and Mekong-Lan Chang.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also claimed that the Royal Government will continue to celebrate the river festival every year in the provinces along the river. By establishing white principles, the Royal Government has been promoting the development of Cambodia's tourism sector, especially the development of riverine tourism products, contributing to making Cambodia a quality tourist destination both regionally and internationally.
Please note that the River Festival in Kampong Chhnang province this year has a total of 395 booths, including 40 foreign booths. In addition to the exhibitions in the river festival, there are also many sports, arts and entertainment activities.
Sports activities include running, football, volleyball, basketball, wrestling (baseball), tug-of-war, badminton, horse racing, cycling, cycling, Khmer boxing, boat racing and bokator. Art activities include: Yike drama "Puthy Sen or Rithy Sen Neang Kangri", dance, song and art performances by Indonesian artists. As well as some other recreational activities. 75 Poor and Elderly Families Receive Donations from Kratie Branch of the Cambodian Red Cross
(Kratie): Mr. Vathorn, Honorary President of Kratie Red Cross Branch, Kratie Province, Distribute humanitarian donations from the Cambodian Red Cross Branch in Kratie Province to a total of 75 poor and elderly families in Khsach Leav Village, O'Kreang Commune, Sambo District, Kratie Province.
