(Phnom Penh): Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh, said that the Phnom Penh Capital Administration is ready and waiting to facilitate investment conditions for investment companies from Chongqing, an allied city with Phnom Penh.
The announcement was made while the Governor met with Han Baochang, Director of the China-Singapore Model Project Management Department of Chongqing, a joint venture partner of Print Real Estate, on March 15, 2019.
On that occasion, Mr. Han Baochang was very interested in investing in construction and real estate in Phnom Penh, and he will bring good news from Phnom Penh to spread to investors in Chongqing.
Mr. Han Baochang stated that his management department also specializes in investment in finance, aviation, land transport and information technology, based in Singapore, and can also expand to Phnom Penh.
For Mr. Khuong Sreng, Phnom Penh has a lot of potential and uncomplicated investment laws, and has a lot of favors for investors, including peace, political stability, security, good order, which gives investors confidence.
