(Tbong Khmum): A Chinese quarry named "Chai Naroth Enbrid Compression" located in Andong Lve village, Chob commune, Tbong Khmum district, Tbong Khmum province, exploded a rock about 250 meters and hit the driver of the truck. Of the company caused sudden death in a pool of blood.
Tbong Khmum Provincial Police Commissioner, Major General Ben Rath, told Fresh News that the incident happened at 5:10 pm on March 15, 2019 at the Chinese stone quarry, causing a man Died immediately at the place named Chum Rachana, 29 years old, driving a truck transporting stones, the above company lives in Svay village, Rohat Teuk commune, Mongkul Borey district, Banteay Meanchey province
Around this case, the General Commissioner stressed that he will open a careful investigation and lead to legal action against the owners of the above location, which may cause harm to the lives of others. The commissioner claims that as determined before the blast, the site owner must notify residents, such as turning on the siren or using a microphone.
According to the commissioner, so far the specialized police force has arrested eight people who may have been involved, including the chief of administration, the chief of interpreters, and one Thai national who was the commander of the blast. The arrest was approved by Tbong Khmum Deputy Prosecutor Pok Dara.
Please be informed that the district police force in cooperation with the provincial police is currently conducting a thorough investigation into this case.
