Mr. Men Vibol also advised people to save water in the dry season in 2019, Cambodia will experience extreme heat and drought, especially during April and May, the temperature will rise to 40 to 42 degrees. Indirect exposure to the effects of the El Nino phenomenon. The Royal Government has called on the authorities and the people to take measures to conserve water for use.
