Deputy Prime Minister Aun Porn Moniroth said that Cambodia's economy has shifted from reliance on basic agriculture to service providers and industry in integrating value chains into the region and the world. Rapid advances in technology will also provide opportunities to address challenges in other areas such as public health, food security, climate change mitigation and education.
The three-day Cambodia Digital Expo 2019 features 100 keynote speakers and keynote speakers, led by experts on key digital technology topics, with more than 150 exhibitors and ongoing opportunities. Liaise with like-minded professionals across Southeast Asia, Asia, Europe and North America.
