(Banteay Meanchey): Mr. Suon Bavor, Governor of Banteay Meanchey Province, on March 15, 2019, held a discussion meeting to plan the Banteay Meanchey Sankranti plan, while this year 2019 is bigger than previous years, with many entertainment programs. Happy to the people to celebrate and receive the New Year angels in the future.
