Samdech Techo Hun Sen also praised South Korea for its efforts to develop itself into a prosperous country and to contribute to the development of other countries, including Cambodia. Samdech Techo thanked Korea for supporting Cambodia in maintaining peace, stability and sustainable development process in a democratic way, as well as for deepening relations and deepening cooperation with Cambodia.
