In the medium term, Cambodia will be able to maintain a growth rate of 7% per year, and Cambodia is on the path to achieving the status of a high middle-income country by 2030 and the country. High income by 2050. Cambodia is strategically located at the heart of ASEAN, an energy region with a GDP of $ 2.7 trillion and a large market of 640 million people.
