Dr. Chan Buntha, Director of Indra Hospital, said that seeing the outstanding development of the health sector in Cambodia under the wise leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, which ensures peace and stability. Across the country, the health sector has grown steadily.
Through the development and growth of this country, the private sector has had the opportunity to contribute to the Royal Government in the development and further growth, including the three doctors, the clinic chief and many specialists. It was decided to set up this Indra Hospital to facilitate the examination and treatment of general diseases for the people.
