Dr. Li Kim Hour, Director of Sihanoukville Sete Clinic, pointed out that the factors of peace and stability have made Cambodia achieve a high economic growth rate of around 7.5%, in which the living standard of the people is more prosperous and the standard of living is higher. Also, the need for public health has increased significantly to participate in improving the well-being of the people.
