(Preah Vihear): Mr. Un Chanda, Governor of Preah Vihear Province, on March 14, 2019, led the commanders of the three armed forces, the directors of the departments, specialized units and local authorities to inspect the site to organize Angkor Sankranti New Year in the resort area. Koh Ker temple is located in Srayong commune, Kulen district, Preah Vihear province.
