In connection with the case of importing pigs from neighboring countries, according to Mr. Thach Ratana, Director of the Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries of Svay Rieng Province, his competent authorities stopped 18 trucks transporting live pigs to be stored at the Department of Agriculture. Svay Rieng province to apply all the techniques of sucking pig blood to be tested in Phnom Penh.
