(Preah Sihanouk): The Governor of Preah Sihanouk Province, Mr. Yon Min, on March 14, 2019, led a professional officer from the Department of Public Works, Sangkat 4 Authority to inspect the condition of LV Road (Street 104) to prepare for the groundbreaking ceremony. This is again after the damage caused to people traveling through since last winter.
