In addition, the Ministry has promoted modern animal husbandry, medium and large-scale animal feed production to support the animal husbandry movement, along with the improvement of technical service system, animal breeding, processing of livestock products, establishment of modern slaughterhouses. As well as facilitating trade in animals and animal products.
