(Phnom Penh): Mr. Nuth Puth Dara, Assistant to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Governor of Dangkor District, continued his visit on March 13, 2019 to visit the people and inspect the construction project of a 380-meter-long concrete road. 05 meters wide, located in Choeung Ek village, Sangkat Choeung Ek.
