(Phnom Penh): Lt. Gen. N. Bora, Deputy Commissioner General of the National Police and Director of the Central Department of Judicial Police, on the afternoon of March 13, 2019, announced the transfer of duties and appointments to the National Police officers of the Criminal Police Department. Of the General Commission of the National Police, Ministry of Interior.
