* First: Colonel Cheav Vibol, Director of the Bureau of Serious Crimes, to be the Deputy Director of the Department * Second: Colonel Chheng Sieng, Assistant Director of the Central Department of Judicial Police to be the Deputy Director of the Department * Third: Lieutenant Colonel Duong Nakry Chea Deputy Director of the Department * Fourth: Colonel Hem Bona, Deputy Director of the Office to be the Director of the Office of Serious Crimes and promoted to the rank of Lieutenant Colonel.
