(Phnom Penh): The Minister of Commerce, Mr. Pan Sosak, requested all CamControl officials to strictly control food safety, not only to confiscate defective goods, but to continue to detect corrupt traders who import all goods and those Involved in further legal action to protect the safety of users across the country.
