(Siem Reap): Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport, presides over here this morning the 7th meeting of the Joint Working Group on Transboundary Transport in the Greater Mekong Subregion. Sokha Angkor Hotel, Siem Reap Province.
The high-level meeting was held to conclude a number of important documents related to the addition of roads and border crossings and to finalize a draft memorandum of understanding on cross-border transport. Reached the signing of those memorandums in accordance with the decision of the Joint Committee for Cross-Border Transport.
