Kampot Provincial Governor Instructs Relevant Departments to Cut Down Cable Cables on Kampot City Roads to Improve the City's Beauty
(Kampot): Mr. Chiao Tai, Governor of Kampot Province, on the afternoon of March 12, 2019, chaired a meeting of the working group on the implementation and downgrade of overhead cable network in Kampot to improve the city. Aesthetics for celebrating and welcoming on the upcoming Khmer New Year and the third round of the Sea Festival at the end of 2019.
During the meeting, Mr. Chiao Tai mentioned that Kampot City is also a city that has already received three lotus flowers, and in order to maintain this reputation, it is necessary for the provincial administration as well as Kampot Municipality, relevant departments, units and district authorities. There must be cooperation to maintain this reputation together. Especially in the improvement of the beauty of the telecommunication cable, which today sees the chaos on the main streets in Kampot.
In order to get results and efficiency of the implementation of the work on the cable system from now on must take a high sense of responsibility to work together. At the same time, the Department of Posts and Telecommunications, which has a role in direct implementation, must take responsibility for the work of organizing the telecommunication network on the messy streets, because without clearing the anarchy, it is not possible to organize. Good, beautiful, new.
The provincial governor advised that the provincial Department of Posts and Telecommunications, as well as the relevant authorities in the development of infrastructure in the city must take into account the network as well as the sewerage must be monitored in accordance with the standards. The correct technique clearly avoids letting cable companies, sewer companies or land transporters in the city in an anarchic way.
Mr. Chiao Tai also encouraged the team to work hard to increase the sense of responsibility and participation together to achieve good results and efficiency, focusing on activities to promote the company to participate and increase activities. Practice to work together to improve the beauty of Kampot.
