Samdech Techo Hun Sen strongly warned that he would use this time to implement the surgical approach, and that both the public administration and the private sector, which are doing wrong business, will be held accountable before the law without discrimination.
Please be informed that the implementation of Samdech Techo's surgical approach has been highly applauded by the people, especially the crackdown on drug cases that are spreading in Cambodian society from urban to rural areas.
Pailin Provincial Governor Inspects the Construction of a Button Road Nearly 1 Kilometer in Pailin City to Promote Construction 100% Completed Before Khmer New Year
(Pailin): On March 12, 2019, Mr. Phan Chanthul, Governor of Pailin Province, led the relevant officers, local authorities and the working group to inspect the construction process of a concrete road with a length of nearly 1,000 meters in Pailin Sangkat, Pailin City. Construction is 100% completed before the upcoming Khmer New Year.
Mr. Phan Chanthul, Governor of Pailin Province, said that the Royal Government of Cambodia under the leadership of Samdech Techo Sen has worked hard to solve all the difficulties and requests of the people and strive to develop the country to progress. All sectors, especially the construction of physical infrastructure, such as: roads, bridges, schools, hospitals, etc.
The provincial governor confirmed that: Roads are the lifeblood of the national economy and families, so there are roads, there is hope, and the construction of this road is really to meet the needs of the people, easy to travel in Daily life, in particular, has made it easier for students to travel to school.
On that occasion, Mr. Phan Chanthul also urged all people who use this road to cooperate and coordinate the impact in the construction of this road as soon as possible as planned and help to maintain. Ensures long-term use, because this one-lane concrete road not only provides easy traffic, it also provides beauty for the city.
Please be informed that: One concrete road that can be built is 780 meters long and 15 meters wide from the point of National Road No. 57 near the Independence Monument, Bor Din Nieu Village to the road of Rattanak Sophoan Primary School, Wat Village, Sangkat Pailin, Pailin City, using the provincial development project budget. .
