Sihanoukville authorities close Chinese club in Koh Rong Samloem, causing a lot of noise to residents and tourists
(Preah Sihanouk): Preah Sihanouk Provincial Authority has decided to close the business of a Chinese entertainment and casino center "Jinting" brand located in Koh Rong Samloem Village, Sangkat Koh Rong Samloem, Sihanoukville, Preah Sihanouk Province, which caused a lot of noise To citizens and tourists.
The closure of the Jinting Entertainment Center on March 12, 2019, was due to several other reasons, including: Lack of wastewater treatment system (sewerage), casino site built on the beach. Sea, the location of the generator on the port, which causes oil to flow into the sea, causing serious damage to the environment.
In addition, the location above the online gambling business license has expired, there have been cases of security guards stationed at the casino shot threatening and causing injuries, loud speakers (speakers) almost every night from dawn. The location of the casino disturbs the accommodation of the people and tourists who come to visit nearby.
Please be informed that in the past, the Sihanoukville Provincial Administration, in cooperation with the Koh Rong Samloem Sangkat Authority, has already instructed and made notes for the casino site owners to demolish the construction site from the beach area, but the casino owner refused to comply.
