According to Minister Ith Sam Heng, these factories include one garment factory, one embroidery factory, one automobile assembly line, one electronics factory, one ball factory, one car assembly and one sugar factory. 1. The minister emphasized that the products produced at these factories are exported to international markets and supplied to domestic markets.
