At the same time, the Director General further instructed all units to continue to work hard to enforce the labor law and to be gentle but firm based on the legal aspects in providing services to taxpayers and revenue collection management.
For this year 2019, in order to ensure the effective management of tax revenue collection and to achieve the maximum plan, the General Department of Taxation will continue to strictly and effectively implement the deep reform policy of The Royal Government has set out some measures as follows:
* Continue to implement and widely disseminate the Royal Government's sub-decree and the guidelines of the General Department of Taxation on tax incentives for small and medium enterprises in priority areas.
