* Encourage and expedite the preparation of draft legal standards to respond to requests and address tax-related challenges of the private sector in order to facilitate the fulfillment of taxpayers' tax obligations.
Electricite du Cambodge (EDC) temporarily suspends electricity supply in some areas in Rukkiri district, Battambang province to plant poles after a car crash
(Battambang): Electricite du Cambodge (EDC) said that on March 12, 2019 at 17:15 pm, the working group of Mong Russey District Office would like to temporarily suspend the power supply: in some parts of Stok Vik commune and Mukrah commune, Rukkiri district, Battambang province, to plant a medium voltage (MV) pole, with a car crashed at Sdok Pravek village, Sdok Pravek commune, Rukkiri district, Battambang province.
Electricite du Cambodge (EDC) has confirmed that the technical team is planting poles and preparing power lines to connect customers to re-use electricity at 00:00 on March 13, 2019.
