In particular, Mr. Nguyen Van Duc expressed his deep gratitude to the Cambodian Veterans Association for its hospitality and goodwill to the delegates on the occasion of their duties in Cambodia.
It should also be noted that in the spirit of cooperation between the Cambodian-Vietnamese Veterans Association, the current visit of the Vietnamese Veterans Delegation to Cambodia aims to experience and enhance mutual assistance between the Veterans Association. Both countries.
