(Phnom Penh): Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Economy and Finance, on March 12, 2019, stated that Cambodia is a country with high potential for living in connection with the opportunities from the revolution. The fourth industry and the digital economy.
