(Svay Rieng): As the economic growth in Bavet City increases from year to year, people also use daily food items also increase, and some people are aware of the sanitary environment to use the garbage collection service From a garbage company. Meanwhile, some people throw garbage on the streets, causing rot and seriously affect the health of both residents and travelers.
According to Mr. Ken, a representative of Hybrid Transportation Company in Bavet City, there are currently 5,050 families in Bavet Sangkat, of which only 528 are service users, and Bavet Leu Village has the highest number of service users. The company has 20 cars and 122 workers.
He said that in the past, only 13 people dumped garbage, but now it has increased to 15 and refuses to pay for services that harm the environment in the city and on public roads. The company has been helping for many years, but this waste is now increasing day by day.
Mr. Seng Seila, Bavet City Governor, used to say that many of the rubbish that people and businesses dumped was true, but he explained and posted a message on the City Hall and his own not to throw rubbish. In the open field. He encouraged people to pack their bags and pay for the service.
