Authorities and Coalition Disseminate the Law to People Arresting Slum Land in Preah Sihanouk Province
(Preah Sihanouk): After the Governor of Preah Sihanouk Province held an emergency meeting with the governors of the four districts, the Provincial Gendarmerie and the Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police Commissioner to educate and disseminate the law and crack down on the anarchic activities of some groups of people who gathered. Violation of other people's land and state public land at Sihanoukville Provincial Hall on Monday evening.
For Tuesday, March 12, 2019, the provincial, district, commune and joint authorities disseminate the law to guide the people and close the notice (S.C.N.) at the scene of the seizure of private land and state land. O Trav point is located in Chamnot Ream village, Bit Trang commune, Prey Nob district, Preah Sihanouk province.
Yun Min, governor of Sihanoukville province, said that the convening of an emergency meeting of the Joint Command to take legal action against a group of people encroaching on slums in Sihanoukville through the help of hidden brokers. For more than a week now, groups of people from different districts and provinces have been gathering to occupy and divide land in almost all districts according to their respective divisions.
After the local authorities have investigated and found that these people are moving from different areas or provinces by the mastermind behind the scenes to encroach on their land. Others, along with state land, also under the pretext that (poor, landless, homeless). But in this case, the authorities understand that it is the strategy of the anarchist people under the trick (win land, lose money).
