(Pursat): Due to the power of alcohol, a man became angry with his wife, suspected of having an affair with a neighbor, and pulled out a machete on the victim (neighbor) who drank four knives together until he died. In a pool of blood pitifully.
This incident happened at 10:49 pm on March 11, 2019 yesterday at Veal Sbov point in Bramoy village, Bramoy commune, Veal Veng district, Pursat province.
The inspector said that before the incident, the victim bought half a case of wine to drink at the suspect's house, when he drank half a case, the suspect went to buy another half case. After getting drunk, both the victim and the suspect slept on the roof with the suspect's brother-in-law and wife.
While asleep, the suspect woke his wife to go to the bathroom, but she refused to go with him. Suddenly, the suspect grabbed his wife until he heard an argument, woke the victim down to interrogate.
The inspector added that the suspect also shouted loudly, "Do not know the story of Anh's wife, be careful to die or be in love with Anh's wife?" The suspect's wife shouted at the suspect, but the suspect pulled out a machete to cut the victim with four knives without missing a mouth (one knife hit the leg, one knife in the front and two knives in the other. From behind) caused death in a pool of blood and then escaped. According to the victim's wife.
After receiving the information, the Veal Veng District Police Inspectorate, in cooperation with the police force, went to the scene to examine and autopsy the victim.
At present, the bodies of the victims have been handed over to their families to prepare a traditional ceremony for the perpetrators, and the police are searching for them to build a case file. Two Chinese pilots killed in Hainan plane crash
