(Phnom Penh): Khmer Breweries on March 12, 2019 announced the completion of the "Clean School" project in 10 schools in Phnom Penh and Battambang in 2018 and announced the opening of new projects in Siem Reap and Banteay Meanchey for 2019, where all these projects cost a total of nearly 700,000 US dollars.
