Separately, Mr. Soy Sona, Director of the Ratanakkiri Provincial Department of Agriculture, called several times but did not answer. Separate sources revealed that if people transport a small amount of wood by motorbike to be used by the Forestry Administration, police, military and military police, only for large trucks transporting timber to the depot. There is no authority to crack down, it is suspected that there are benefits from the owners of those depots.
