Case 1: On March 9, 2019, at 14:30, the specialized force of the Anti-Drug Department (A5) in cooperation with the police of Chbar Ampov district cracked down on drug trafficking cases at no plot. Tiger Street No., Toul Ta Chan Village, Sangkat Prek Eang, Khan Chbar Ampov.
Result: Detained 1 suspect named Phum Kakada, Male, 28 years old, Nationality Khmer, Uncertain occupation, Staying in a rented room, Sangkat Stung Meanchey 1, Khan Meanchey. The other faction escaped. Confiscated exhibits include: 1 large package of methamphetamine (ICE) weighing 960.26 grams.
Currently, the suspects, including exhibits, are being processed by the specialized police force for legal action.
