General Professor Chea Dara said that the above results confirm that Cambodia has a leader full of talent, wisdom, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, who has set out a number of strategic policies that lead to Cambodia has been successful in battle, military, political and diplomatic as well as legal, and has enjoyed peace, stability and development in all areas to this day.
The Rector also thanked the parents and guardians of the 680 new cadets who have sacrificed their children to join the army and asked all of them to pay attention to their studies and improve their ability to become real successors. Participate in maintaining peace and development under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
Specialist lawyers inform of the implementation of the Supreme Court Judgment No. 345 on irregular construction that is not related to the state
(Phnom Penh): On March 11, 2019, a group of specialized lawyers announced the implementation of the Supreme Court Judgment No. 345 "Ch" dated November 21, 2017 on land occupied and fenced. As well as some irregular construction.
The expert attorneys further stated that the immovable property that the court handed over to the creditors of the implementation was not state land or land related to the subject of any foreclosure by the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries. It is a land with a title and not the land of Duke Siv Kong Triv.
The lawyers also warned that those who try to take control of other people's real estate are against the law, and the lawyers will take strict action against the masterminds, instigators, facilitators and accomplices, and their accomplices along the way. Law.
Sihanoukville mayor claims to continue arresting cars and motorbikes parked illegally on the road
(Sihanoukville): The Governor of Sihanoukville, Mr. Ey Sok Leng, said that the municipal administration will continue to send professional officers to organize order by crane all kinds of vehicles and motorbikes that are parked in a disorderly manner on the road. The public kept it in the city hall for a long time before being fined as a warning to the owners to resign.
Mr. Ey Sok Leng said that on Sunday, March 10, yesterday, city administration officials seized a total of nearly 30 cars and motorcycles and stored them for several days at the city hall to punish the owners of those vehicles for Parking affects public roads in Sihanoukville, especially the road in front of Phsar Leu.
The mayor said that the city administration will not deal with the seizure of cars and motorbikes in a disorderly manner by paying fines immediately and then asking the owners to return the cars and motorbikes immediately. Save for several days or reach a storage period of 1 month to deal with later.
"As for the allegation that the daily car and motorcycle raids are carried out only by people without backing and without power, it is not true. "Public order activities in Sihanoukville, the authorities will regularly and everywhere in the city, regardless of whether the owners are Cambodian or foreign." This is the additional confirmation of the Governor of Sihanoukville.
Mr. Ey Sok Leng stated that since the beginning of 2019, dozens of cars and motorbikes have been seized by the municipal authorities and stored at the Sihanoukville City Hall, bringing them to be stored for a long time as a warning to The owner releases.
Regarding the above action, it has received a lot of applause and support from the public, especially people who use public roads or drivers of all kinds of vehicles in downtown Sihanoukville because it can avoid any congestion.
The people request the Governor of Sihanoukville, Mr. Ey Sok Leng, to continue to organize this public order regularly and effectively, without understanding the anarchists. In addition, it is requested that the Sihanoukville Administration Authority continue to take measures to prevent heavy trucks from entering the city during the day effectively, as it has caused traffic congestion and caused traffic accidents almost every day.
