The General Commission of the National Police calls on people to be careful of fires in the dry season 2019 (Video Inside) (Kampong Speu): Major General Neth Vantha, Director of the Fire Prevention and Rescue Police Department of the General Commission of the National Police urged the fire police. Increase prevention and call on people to be more vigilant regarding fires, while some areas are experiencing drought.
According to the director of the department, there were 534 fires in 2018, an increase of 20 times, killing 17 people and injuring 52 others, burning 553 houses and burning 396 stalls. . Most of the fires are still caused by improper electrical wiring and neglected stoves, candles and incense burners.
Speaking at the opening ceremony of the training course on fire prevention and rescue, Ms. Zheng Xin, CEO of Cambodia Fair Enterprise, which sponsors the training, said that her company will continue to assist the General Commission of Police. The nation continues to improve the professional capacity of the police to prevent firefighting more effectively.
Kampong Cham Provincial Armed Forces arrested a fraudulent fortune teller who tried to rape a woman while going to a zodiac sign in Kampong Siem district!
(Kampong Cham): Kampong Cham Provincial Gendarmerie arrested a fraudulent fortune teller who attempted to rape a woman when she was called to a zodiac sign at a rented room in Ampil Leu village, Ampil commune, Kampong Siem district.
Brigadier General So Savoeun, Commander of the Kampong Cham Provincial Gendarmerie, told Fresh News on the afternoon of March 11, 2019 that the arrest of the fraudster was made by the Provincial Gendarmerie Department of Justice. Directed by Brigadier General Sem Kheang, Director of the Department of Justice, after receiving information from people living in rented rooms there that there was a case of rape.
Then, on March 9, 2019, specialized forces sent the suspect to court, and Deputy Prosecutor Sao Sopheak was charged with attempted rape under Articles 27 and 239, and Investigating Judge Suy Sophea Attempted rape and issuance of detention order No. 267, dated March 10, 2019. The suspect is currently being held at Kampong Cham Provincial Prison.
