Cozy Family Cosmetics Company Awards Outstanding Members to Increase Women's Involvement in Business
(Phnom Penh): Today, both in Cambodia as well as other countries in the world have been paying close attention to increasing the participation of women in all situations and circumstances of women's lives. For this reason, Cozy Family Cosmetics Company has organized an award for its outstanding members to increase the participation of women in Cambodia more widely.
Oknha Ouch Sambath, President of Cozy Family Cosmetics Company, stated that this event was organized to celebrate the 108th International Women's Day and to encourage his outstanding members who have worked hard in the business of sales and distribution. Become a leader who can create many members on your own.
He recalled his history of struggle: "I started out with my bare hands from a small meatball stall, developed myself to this day, becoming the president of a large cosmetics company due to the effort to see through the opportunity. And we must seize the opportunity to grow fast like this.
He added that now our bamboo is deeply rooted for eight generations and will branch out into a dense bamboo forest, which has grown to 48,400 members so far. The mission to treat the poor in Cambodia is also shining brighter, and now nearly 50,000 women who are doing business with warm family companies are enjoying their daily income.
Oknha Ouch Sambath expressed his strong position and belief that "Cozy Family Company will have 100,000 members in 2019 and will become a world-class cosmetics company when his company turns 15 years old in 2030 in the future.
Ministry of Health holds a meeting to review health work in 2018 and set the direction for 2019
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of March 11, 2019, the Ministry of Health held the 40th Annual Meeting of 2018 and the direction of 2019 under the chairmanship of the Minister of Health, Prof. Mam Bunheng. The ceremony took place at the Sofitel Hotel.
During the ceremony, Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his happiness that the police cracked down on a large drug den in a rock club last month.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated: "Crossing that ugly place that has just been discovered recently, Rock. We are also surprised why this area is a place that destroys the well-being of the people. I am very happy that our police cracked down in time, should have cracked down first, but we just cracked Near the school, there is a small drug store in this place.
It should be noted that on February 23, 2019, the Phnom Penh Municipal Police cracked down on drug offenses at the Rock Entertainment Center located along Monivong Blvd., Sangkat Tonle Bassac, Khan Chamkarmon, Phnom Penh. 311 suspects, including 14 Chinese nationals, confiscated more than 39 kilograms of drugs and 9 kilograms of drugs, 2 bites, 12 drug scales and a pistol.
On March 2, 2019, the police decided to send 17 suspects in the case of drug bust in the form of Rock Entertainment Center to the court after a urine autopsy and collected enough evidence. The 17 suspects included a woman, mostly young men and women between the ages of 19 and 21.
Significant remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of handing over diplomas to more than 3,000 students of the Royal University of Law and Economics this Monday morning
(Phnom Penh): On Monday, March 11, 2019, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presented diplomas to students of the Royal University of Law and Economics (RULES). ) More than 3,000 people have successfully graduated.
Dr. Luy Channa also said that there are 2,501 undergraduate and 542 undergraduate students. Dr. Luy Channa said that since the opening of the training after the fall of the genocidal regime of Pol Pot, the university has already awarded 19 degrees to students. There are more than 50,000 students who have graduated from this university.
The following are the important and meaningful remarks of Samdech Techo Hun Sen:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech also used to teach at the Royal University of Law and Economics related to foreign policy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his congratulations to the authorities for cracking down on drugs in the rock club, and Samdech Techo Hun Sen ordered to find the ringleader and take the strictest action according to the law.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that opening up opportunities for the private sector to participate in higher education is to meet the needs of parents and students.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commended all the management and professors for their joint efforts in training human resources.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen encourages higher education institutions to compete in education and build a reputation as a university in the United States. However, Samdech Techo stated that this competition is about the quality of education, not by overthrowing each other.
* Samdech Techo, Head of the Royal Government, congratulated the winning students as well as their parents, relatives and relatives.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen encouraged today's graduates to further strengthen their abilities. Samdech Techo stated that society is developing very fast today. Samdech Techo said that standing still is equivalent to walking backwards.
* Samdech Techo stated that the expansion of the capacity of knowledge is not only for students, even government officials must strive to strengthen their capacity.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call and encourage women to study more. Samdech Techo Hun Sen also asked his parents and husband to encourage his wife and children to study hard.
